{
  "name": "l0_ambient_init",
  "about": "`CAmbientGeneric` initialization, `walks/L0-r005.md`. The KeyValue override `vfunc110` 0x101ada80 parses the `m_dpv` (+0x458) keys: `pitch`/`pitchstart` clamped [0,255], `spinup`/`spindown` clamped [0,100] then (101-v)*64 and mirrored (+0x498/+0x49c), `volstart` clamped [0,10] then *10, `fadein`/`fadeout` atof -> ftol(100/x*0.2) << 8 and mirrored (+0x4a8/+0x4ac; x=0 gives the integer indefinite, 0), `lfotype` > 4 -> 2 with no lower clamp, `lforate` clamped [0,1000] << 8, `preset` unclamped. `Spawn` 0x101ac310: `m_iSoundLevel` from FUN_101ac570 at 0x101ac326, then an empty `message` warns `EMPTY AMBIENT AT` and UTIL_Removes the entity (0x101ac4a0); else `m_flNextThink`=0, the think/use pointers (0x1000969c, 0x100131e2), `m_fActive`=0, `m_fLooping` = !(flag_force_looping==0 && spawnflags&0x20), `m_nSndFlags` |= 0x800 no_sfx | 0x1000 no_voice_duck | 0x200 skip_collide | 0x100 force_looping, source handle -1, tail-jump (0x101ac49a) to `Precache` 0x101ac930 (engine PrecacheSound only when strlen > 1 and name[0] != '!'; then the dpv pass; `m_fActive`=1 iff !(spawnflags&0x10) && m_fLooping). The dpv pass FUN_101ad0f0: volume ceiling = clamp(health*10, 0, 100); preset 1..27 copies the 25-word row at 0x10595eb4+p*0x64 and transforms it; running fadein/spinup from their initials, current volume = fadein ? volstart : ceiling, current pitch = spinup ? pitchstart : pitch (0 -> 100), the 8.8 accumulators, cspincount 1, cspinup's ceiling step, and pitch 100 -> 101 when any spin or pitch LFO is set. Reported as `fail`, a parsed word, a Spawn/Precache word, the removal or a site payload differs from retail's. Slices 2-3 (walks/L0-r006.md): the walk's hand-traced key set (amb_walk: fadein 2 -> 2560, spinup 50 -> 3264, pitch floor 50 / volume floor 50 at the start of the ramps), fadein 3 -> 1536, preset 7, spawnflags 1 -> level 0, and the activation pass vfunc113 0x101ac9c0 on a runtime spawn (the self handle, the flags-0x8 emission, m_flNextThink = curtime + 0.1; nothing for an inactive one). The modulating rows are probed 0.05 s after their spawn, before the think FUN_101acb70 (first run at +0.1) moves the running words.",
